        "id": "s3",
        "start": 22,
        "end": 31.003,
        "text": "Now I ask what happens if Friday's fund cutoff moves from four to three. The model turns my question into one proposed rule."
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "start": 33,
        "end": 42.366,
        "text": "I confirm the change and replay two orders. The earlier one still settles Friday. The three-thirty order now waits until Monday."
